      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p>Livevideo delas och visas via en videodistributionsserver. Servern nås med de inloggningsuppgifter som erhålls från Deploy-appen.</p>\n<h2 id=\"deploy-app-inloggningar-och-strömningslistor\"><a href=\"#deploy-app-inloggningar-och-strömningslistor\">Deploy App-inloggningar och strömningslistor</a></h2>\n<p><code>https://mtx.</code><strong><code>canadian-goose.pvarki.fi</code></strong><code>:4626/api/v1/direct/credentials</code></p>\n<p><code>https://mtx.</code><strong><code>canadian-goose.pvarki.fi</code></strong><code>:4626/api/v1/direct/streams</code></p>\n<h2 id=\"namngivningspraxis\"><a href=\"#namngivningspraxis\">Namngivningspraxis:</a></h2>\n<h4 id=\"namngivning-av-ström\"><a href=\"#namngivning-av-ström\"><strong>Namngivning av ström</strong></a></h4>\n<p><code>live/verktyg/callsign</code></p>\n<h4 id=\"lista-över-verktyg-exempel\"><a href=\"#lista-över-verktyg-exempel\">Lista över verktyg, exempel</a></h4>\n<p><code>icu, gopro, uas, ipcam</code></p>\n<h2 id=\"strömningsverktyg\"><a href=\"#strömningsverktyg\">Strömningsverktyg</a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"publicera-en-ström\"><a href=\"#publicera-en-ström\">Publicera en ström</a></h3>\n<h4 id=\"opentak-icu\"><a href=\"#opentak-icu\">Opentak ICU</a></h4>\n<p><code>rtmps://</code><strong><code>canadian-goose.pvarki.fi</code></strong><code>:1936/live/icu/</code><strong><code>Callsign</code></strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"/sv/wikis/mtx/opentak-icu-ceJbKwGZb9\">Opentak ICU</a></p>\n<h4 id=\"gopro-app\"><a href=\"#gopro-app\">GoPro App</a></h4>\n<p><code>rtmps://</code><strong><code>canadian-goose.pvarki.fi</code></strong><code>:1936/live/gopro/</code><strong><code>Callsing</code></strong><code>?user=</code><strong><code>USERNAME</code></strong><code>&#x26;pass=</code><strong><code>PASSWORD</code></strong></p>\n<h4 id=\"uastool\"><a href=\"#uastool\">Uastool</a></h4>\n<p><code>srt://</code><strong><code>canadian-goose.pvarki.fi</code></strong><code>:8890?streamid=publish:live/icu/</code><strong><code>Callsign</code></strong><code>:</code><strong><code>USERNAME</code></strong><code>:</code><strong><code>PASSWORD</code></strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"/sv/wikis/mtx/uas-tool-stromning-5JeQ6TxVVy\">Uastool Strömning</a></p>\n<h3 id=\"titta-på-en-ström\"><a href=\"#titta-på-en-ström\">Titta på en ström</a></h3>\n<h4 id=\"vlc\"><a href=\"#vlc\">VLC</a></h4>\n<p><code>srt://</code><strong><code>canadian-goose.pvarki.fi</code></strong><code>:8890?streamid=read:live/icu/</code><strong><code>Callsign</code></strong><code>:</code><strong><code>USERNAME</code></strong><code>:</code><strong><code>PASSWORD</code></strong></p>\n<p><code>https://</code><strong><code>canadian-goose.pvarki.fi</code></strong><code>:9888/live/icu/</code><strong><code>Callsign</code></strong><code>/index.m3u8</code></p>\n<h4 id=\"webbläsare\"><a href=\"#webbläsare\">Webbläsare</a></h4>\n<p><code>https://</code><strong><code>canadian-goose.pvarki.fi</code></strong><code>:9888/live/icu/</code><strong><code>Callsign</code></strong><code>/</code></p>\n<h4 id=\"atak\"><a href=\"#atak\">ATAK</a></h4>\n<p><code>rtmps://</code><strong><code>canadian-goose.pvarki.fi</code></strong><code>:1936/live/icu/</code><strong><code>Callsign</code></strong><code>?user=</code><strong><code>USERNAME</code></strong><code>&#x26;pass=</code><strong><code>PASSWORD</code></strong></p>\n<h4 id=\"dela-länken-via-takserver\"><a href=\"#dela-länken-via-takserver\">Dela länken via Takserver</a></h4>\n<p><code>rtmps://</code><strong><code>canadian-goose.pvarki.fi</code></strong><code>:1936/live/icu/</code><strong><code>Callsign</code></strong><code>?user=</code><strong><code>USERNAME</code></strong><code>&#x26;pass=</code><strong><code>PASSWORD</code></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"/content/images/sv/attachments/106978dd70770c1e.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"469\"> Takserver - Hamburgarmenyn → Data → Video Feed Manager → Add</p>\n<h2 id=\"strömningsprotokoll\"><a href=\"#strömningsprotokoll\">Strömningsprotokoll</a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"publicering-av-ström\"><a href=\"#publicering-av-ström\">Publicering av ström</a></h3>\n<h4 id=\"rtsps-publicering\"><a href=\"#rtsps-publicering\">RTSPS-publicering</a></h4>\n<p><code>rtsps://</code><strong><code>canadian-goose.pvarki.fi</code></strong><code>:8322/live/icu/</code><strong><code>Callsign</code></strong></p>\n<p><code>rtsps://</code><strong><code>USERNAME</code></strong><code>:</code><strong><code>PASSWORD</code></strong><code>@</code><strong><code>canadian-goose.pvarki.fi</code></strong><code>:8322/live/icu/</code><strong><code>Callsign</code></strong></p>\n<h4 id=\"rtmps-publicering\"><a href=\"#rtmps-publicering\">RTMPS-publicering</a></h4>\n<p><code>rtmps://</code><strong><code>canadian-goose.pvarki.fi</code></strong><code>:1936/live/icu/</code><strong><code>Callsign</code></strong></p>\n<p><code>rtmps://</code><strong><code>USERNAME</code></strong><code>:</code><strong><code>PASSWORD</code></strong><code>@</code><strong><code>canadian-goose.pvarki.fi</code></strong><code>:1936/live/icu/</code><strong><code>Callsign</code></strong></p>\n<h4 id=\"srt-publicering\"><a href=\"#srt-publicering\">SRT-publicering</a></h4>\n<p><code>srt://</code><strong><code>canadian-goose.pvarki.fi</code></strong><code>:8890?streamid=publish:live/icu/</code><strong><code>Callsign</code></strong><code>&#x26;pkt_size=1316</code></p>\n<p><code>srt://</code><strong><code>canadian-goose.pvarki.fi</code></strong><code>:8890?streamid=publish:live/icu/</code><strong><code>Callsign</code></strong><code>:</code><strong><code>USERNAME</code></strong><code>:</code><strong><code>PASSWORD</code></strong><code>&#x26;pkt_size=1316</code></p>\n<h3 id=\"titta-på-ström\"><a href=\"#titta-på-ström\">Titta på ström</a></h3>\n<h4 id=\"titta-i-webbläsare-med-hls-protokollet\"><a href=\"#titta-i-webbläsare-med-hls-protokollet\">Titta i webbläsare med HLS-protokollet</a></h4>\n<p><code>https://</code><strong><code>canadian-goose.pvarki.fi</code></strong><code>:9888/live/icu/</code><strong><code>Callsign</code></strong></p>\n<h4 id=\"titta-i-vlc-player\"><a href=\"#titta-i-vlc-player\">Titta i VLC Player</a></h4>\n<p><code>srt://</code><strong><code>canadian-goose.pvarki.fi</code></strong><code>:8890?streamid=read:live/icu/</code><strong><code>Callsign</code></strong><code>:</code><strong><code>USERNAME</code></strong><code>:</code><strong><code>PASSWORD</code></strong></p>\n<p><code>https://</code><strong><code>canadian-goose.pvarki.fi</code></strong><code>:9888/live/icu/</code><strong><code>Callsign</code></strong><code>/index.m3u8</code></p>\n<h2 id=\"du-kan-också-dela-länkar-som-qr-kod\"><a href=\"#du-kan-också-dela-länkar-som-qr-kod\">Du kan också dela länkar som QR-kod</a></h2>\n<p>Gratis verktyg för att skapa QR-koder</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://new.express.adobe.com/tools/generate-qr-code\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://new.express.adobe.com/tools/generate-qr-code</a></p>"
